@startuml
actor User
participant Launcher as "DesktopLauncherBootstrap"
participant Helper as "SceneActivationHelper"
participant Workspace as "ProjectWorkspaceService"
participant Editor as "DesktopStandaloneEditorBootstrap"

User -> Launcher: Select project / Create project
Launcher -> Workspace: Validate path / create project
Workspace --> Launcher: Valid
Launcher -> Helper: BeginDeferredActivation(asyncOp, "DesktopEditor")
Helper -> Launcher: monitor progress
Helper -> Editor: allowSceneActivation (when ready)
Editor -> Workspace: Initialize editor state
Editor --> User: Editor UI shown

@enduml
